# Committed release switches for every production `vite build` (web Hosting, Android and iOS
# `cap sync`). Non-secret only: tokens and keys stay in the untracked `.env.production.local`.
# Vite reads this file only in production mode; tests and the dev server do not see it.
#
# Onboarding 2.0 + the Enable Location screen are ON for release builds.
# Rollback: build with VITE_ONBOARDING_V2=0 set in the shell (process env beats this file),
# or revert this line. No data migration is needed either way.
VITE_ONBOARDING_V2=1
